title: "ATR Eval: agent hijacking tests"
abstract: >-
  Reference runner and test library for the ATR Agent Hijacking Tests specification (draft 0.9). It tests whether
  content an AI agent reads can steer it, with deterministic checks and signed receipts anyone can re-verify.
